QIS-derived code
----------------

docs/_ext/trendfollowing_callouts.py was adapted from
QuantInvestStrats/docs/_ext/qis_callouts.py. The original Artur Sepp attribution
is retained in that file. The full QIS MIT notice follows.

The zero-seeded portfolio covariance compatibility kernel in
src/trendfollowing/systems/backtest_utils.py adapts compute_portfolio_var_np from
qis/portfolio/risk/ewm_covar_risk.py, retaining its update and missing-data rules.
Reviewed upstream version: v5.0.9, commit f13054f8316d882ae704fd8d0293d031111ef0dd.

Source: https://github.com/ArturSepp/QuantInvestStrats

